{
  "slug": "agentforce-adlc",
  "name": "Agentforce Adlc",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Agentforce Agent Development Life Cycle — author, discover, scaffold, deploy, test, and optimize .agent files",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills**, **4 agents** and **2 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `agentforce-generate` (Build, modify, optimize, debug, and deploy agents with Agentforce Agent Script), `agentforce-observe` (Analyze production Agentforce agent behavior using session traces and Data Cloud), `agentforce-test` (Write, run, and analyze structured test suites for Agentforce agents — functional AND security)\n- **Agents** (4): `adlc-author` (Writes Agentforce Agent Script (.agent) files from requirements), `adlc-engineer` (Platform engineer — scaffolds Flow/Apex metadata and deploys agent bundles), `adlc-orchestrator` (Plan-mode orchestrator for the Agent Development Life Cycle), `adlc-qa` (Tests Agentforce agents and optimizes based on session trace analysis)\n- **Hooks** (2): `PreToolUse`, `PostToolUse`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install agentforce-adlc@claude-plugins-official` from `SalesforceAIResearch/agentforce-adlc`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 3,
    "agent": 4,
    "hook": 2
  },
  "sourceType": "community",
